---
import SiteHead from '../components/SiteHead.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import StyleGallery from '../components/StyleGallery.astro';
import catalog from '../lib/styles';
---
<html lang="en">
  <head><SiteHead title="Styles — Omalux" description="Explore Omalux looks, rendered with darktable. Compare every style on the same photograph." /></head>
  <body>
    <SiteHeader />
    <main>
      <section class="intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE LOOK LIBRARY</p>
        <h1>A different feeling.<br /><span>The same photograph.</span></h1>
        <p class="lead">Find your color. Every style says what it does, read from the style file itself.</p>
        <p class="note"><span></span>Rendered with darktable · Every look measured on the same thirty photographs</p>
      </section>
      <StyleGallery catalog={catalog} />
      <section class="install">
        <h2>Use them in darktable</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>
            <h3>Get the files</h3>
            <p>Clone the repository, or download it as an archive. The styles are in <code>catalog/styles</code>.</p>
            <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/chriopter/omalux.git</code></pre>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Point darktable at the colour tables</h3>
            <p>Preferences → processing → <em>3D LUT root folder</em>: choose <code>catalog/styles</code>. Styles reference their <code>.cube</code> relative to it.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Import the styles</h3>
            <p>Lighttable → <em>styles</em> → import, then select the <code>.dtstyle</code> files. They appear as <code>Omalux|group|name</code> and apply to the photograph you have open.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p class="hint">A style is the look. What happens before it, per camera, are the <a href="/cameras">camera presets</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <aside class="closing"><h2>Find a look. Make it yours.</h2><p>These styles are included in Omalux. Open a photo, choose a look, and adjust from there.</p><a href="https://github.com/chriopter/omalux/releases/latest">Get Omalux <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></aside>
    </main>
    <SiteFooter />
  </body>
</html>
<style>
main { max-width: 1328px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 58px 32px 0; }
.intro { padding: 12px 0 56px; }
.eyebrow { color: var(--accent); font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .2em; margin-bottom: 22px; }
h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5.7vw, 4.6rem); line-height: 1.07; letter-spacing: -.045em; font-weight: 620; }
h1 span { color: var(--muted); }
.lead { max-width: 570px; margin-top: 24px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7; }
.note { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; margin-top:24px; color:var(--muted); font-size:.75rem; }
.note span { width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:#d0ad69; }
.install { margin-top: 72px; }
.install h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; letter-spacing: -.03em; font-weight: 550; margin-bottom: 28px; }
.install ol { list-style: none; counter-reset: step; display: grid; gap: 26px; }
.install li { counter-increment: step; padding-left: 52px; position: relative; }
.install li::before { content: counter(step); position: absolute; left: 0; top: -2px; width: 32px; height: 32px;
  display: grid; place-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 50%; color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; }
.install h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 550; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
.install p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; font-size: .93rem; margin-top: 6px; max-width: 640px; }
.install em { color: var(--fg); font-style: normal; }
.install pre { margin-top: 12px; padding: 12px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; overflow-x: auto; }
.install pre code { color: var(--fg); font-size: .82rem; }
.install code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: .85em; }
.hint { margin-top: 30px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; }
.hint a { color: var(--fg); text-underline-offset: 4px; }
.closing { margin-top:72px; padding:48px 0 64px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
.closing h2 { font-size:1.6rem; letter-spacing:-.03em; font-weight:550; }
.closing p { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.7; margin:12px 0 24px; }
.closing a { color:var(--fg); text-underline-offset:5px; }
@media(max-width:600px) { main {padding:32px 20px 0;} .intro{padding-bottom:36px;} }
</style>
